.TH UCCD 8 "2026-11-27" "ucc-rusted 0.0.1" "System Administration Manual"
.SH NAME
uccd \- Uniwill Control Center system control daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B uccd
.RB [ \-\-start ]
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.RB [ \-\-help ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B uccd
is the privileged system daemon of
.B ucc-rusted
for Uniwill, Clevo, Mechrevo, and TUXEDO laptops.
It manages fan curves, power and TDP profiles, CPU/GPU telemetry,
charging thresholds, keyboard and lightbar illumination, display refresh
rate coordination, and Bluetooth water cooler control, exposing the
.B com.uniwill.uccd
interface on the system D-Bus at object path
.IR /com/uniwill/uccd .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-start
Start the D-Bus service loop and apply hardware initialization, power-state
profile selection, and periodic telemetry/fan control workers.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the daemon version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Display command-line usage information and exit.
.SH SYSTEMD UNITS
.TP
.B uccd.service
Runs
.B /usr/bin/uccd \-\-start
under systemd hardening constraints and restores automatic firmware cooling via
.B /usr/lib/ucc/ucc-hardware \-\-fan-auto
on exit.
.TP
.B uccd-sleep.service
Executes
.B /usr/lib/ucc/ucc-sleep prepare
before system sleep and
.B /usr/lib/ucc/ucc-sleep resume
after wake-up to save and restore active hardware lighting and cooling state.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/ucc/settings
Persistent configuration and custom profile store managed by
.BR uccd .
.TP
.I /usr/share/dbus-1/system.d/com.uniwill.uccd.conf
System D-Bus policy configuration for
.BR com.uniwill.uccd .
.TP
.I /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/com.uniwill.uccd.policy
Polkit action definitions authorizing desktop read/control operations.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ucc-cli (1),
.BR systemctl (1),
.BR systemd-analyze (1)
